      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain in the head and neck region is a common symptom in elderly people, with degenerative disease and neoplasms being the most frequent causes. Pain of neuralgic, orbital and vascular origin requires a multidisciplinary approach. Adequate suppression of pain by appropriate medical or surgical methods is of paramount importance to the patient's well-being even when the underlying disease cannot be cured."},
